        },
        {
          "text": "Mbĩthukĩĩsyai, inyw’ĩ ithama; ĩw’ai, inyw’ĩ ngo sya andũ, ila syĩ kũasa: Yeova nĩwambĩtie o kuma ĩvunĩ; kuma nĩ nda kwa mwaitũ nĩwawetie syĩtwa yakwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
