          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na nũseũvĩtye kanyw’a wakwa wĩthĩwe ta ũvyũ mũĩ; nũmbithĩte muunyĩnĩ wa kw’oko kwake: na nũndw’ĩkĩthĩtye mũsyĩ mũtendeu mũno; nũmbithĩte thyakanĩ wake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
