          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeova, Mwovosya wa Isilaeli, Ũla Mũtheu wake, emwĩa ũla ũvũthaw’a nĩ andũ, ũla ũthĩthawa nĩ mbaĩ, mũthũkũmi wa asumbĩki atĩĩ: Asumbĩ makoona na makookĩla; o na anene me mbee ũsumbĩnĩ, na makathaitha; ũndũ wa Yeova ũla wĩ na kĩthito, Ũla Mũtheu wa Isilaeli, ũla wakũnyuvie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
