              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Nĩnakũsũngĩie ĩvinda yĩla yĩtĩkĩlĩtwe, na mũthenya wa ũtangĩĩo nĩnaũtethisye; na ngakũsũvĩa, na ũkũnengane wĩthĩwe ũtianĩo wa andũ, wũkĩlye nthĩ ĩno, ũtume matiĩwa motiĩo ala maeketwe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
