          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inai, inyw’ĩ matu; ĩthĩwa na ũtanu, we nthĩ; ambĩlĩlyai kwina, inyw’ĩ iĩma: nũndũ Yeova nũkiakiĩtye andũ make, na akamew’ĩa tei ala make ala mathĩnaw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
